ang_notes":[],"note_content":"據載記，石虔襲破振、仲于滶水，振、仲退保管城。又據水經，沔水逕郡縣故城南，又東，滶水注之；滶水西南注于沔，寔曰滶口。沔水又南逕石城西；城因山爲固，晉竟陵郡所治也。以此考之，管城當在滶水北。","note_content_jianti_auto":"据载记，石虔袭破振、仲于滶水，振、仲退保管城。又据水经，沔水迳郡县故城南，又东，滶水注之；滶水西南注于沔，寔曰滶口。沔水又南迳石城西；城因山为固，晋竟陵郡所治也。以此考之，管城当在滶水北。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f49a-db0e-11ef-8540-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"沈約","people_name_jianti_auto":"沈约","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4b0-db0e-11ef-a1dc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"成帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"成帝","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4b1-db0e-11ef-afae-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"庾亮","people_name_jianti_auto":"庾亮","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4b2-db0e-11ef-a849-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"司州","place_name_jianti_auto":"司州","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4b3-db0e-11ef-bf27-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南河東郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南河东郡","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4b4-db0e-11ef-ad8f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆州","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4b5-db0e-11ef-8bb2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南郡","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4b6-db0e-11ef-a385-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"松滋縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"松滋县","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4b7-db0e-11ef-9510-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"江左","place_name_jianti_auto":"江左","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4b8-db0e-11ef-a183-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东郡","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4b9-db0e-11ef-ab96-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"沈約曰：成帝咸康三年，征西將軍庾亮以司州僑戶立南河東郡，屬荊州。五代志：南郡松滋縣，江左置河東郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"沈约曰：成帝咸康三年，征西将军庾亮以司州侨户立南河东郡，属荆州。五代志：南郡松滋县，江左置河东郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4af-db0e-11