:"宜阳侯","people_xingming":"桓谦","start_index":128,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4d3-db0e-11ef-88b4-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":388,"link_td_description":"桓石虔，表字不详，小字镇恶，谯国龙亢（今安徽怀远）人。晋朝重要将领，桓彝之孙，桓豁之子，以勇猛矫捷闻名，官至豫州刺史。","link_td_id":"Q10012342","link_td_number_id":1464855,"people_name":"桓石虔","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓石虔","people_xingming":"桓石虔","start_index":133,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4d4-db0e-11ef-9336-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":20,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4be-db0e-11ef-a5bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"荊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"荆州","resolved_place_entity_id":125,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4bf-db0e-11ef-b5a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"竟陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"竟陵","resolved_place_entity_id":919,"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4c0-db0e-11ef-ac9e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南平","place_name_jianti_auto":"南平","resolved_place_entity_id":1442,"start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4c4-db0e-11ef-8c34-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"管城","place_name_jianti_auto":"管城","resolved_place_entity_id":2953,"start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4cd-db0e-11ef-9ccf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"管城","place_name_jianti_auto":"管城","resolved_place_entity_id":2953,"start_index":102,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4ce-db0e-11ef-a1a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","resolved_place_entity_id":114,"start_index":137,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4d5-db0e-11ef-ad70-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"淝水之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0717"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、承天府（卷七十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《水经注》：滶水出新市东北，西南流注于沔。沔水经都县故城...","context_before":"管城[府西北百里，故戍守处也。","source_end_index":88,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"69abae8f-37b9-5840-8109-8a017b569f22","source_start_index":15,"source_text":"晋太元六年，苻秦荆州刺史都贵，自襄阳进兵寇竟陵。荆州刺史桓冲，使桓石虔等击却之，拔其管城。《载记》：时石虔破秦将阎振、吴仲于滶水。振、仲退保管城。"}],"path":"湖广方舆纪要/四、承天府（卷七十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"8秦荊州刺史都貴遣其司馬閻振、中兵參軍吳仲帥衆二萬寇竟陵，桓沖遣南平太守桓石虔、衞軍參軍桓石民等帥水陸二萬拒之。石民，石虔之弟也。十二月，甲辰，石虔襲擊振、仲，大破之，振、仲退保管城。石虔進攻之，癸亥，拔管城，獲振、仲，斬首七千級，俘虜萬人。詔封桓沖子謙爲宜陽侯。以桓石虔領河東太守。","content_fanyi":"前秦荆州刺史都贵派遣司马阎振、中兵参军吴仲率领二万人马进犯竟陵，桓冲派南平太守桓石虔、卫军参军桓石民等率领水陆二万人进行抵御。桓石民是桓石虔的弟弟。十二月甲辰日，石虔袭击阎振、吴仲，大破其军，阎振、吴仲退守管城。石虔继续进攻，癸亥日攻克管城，擒获阎振、吴仲，斩首七千级，俘虏一万人。东晋朝廷下诏封桓冲的儿子桓谦为宜阳侯。又任命桓石虔兼任河东太守。","content_jianti_auto":"8秦荆州刺史都贵遣其司马阎振、中兵参军吴仲帅众二万寇竟陵，桓冲遣南平太守桓石虔、衞军参军桓石民等帅水陆二万拒之。石民，石虔之弟也。十二月，甲辰，石虔袭击振、仲，大破之，振、仲退保管城。石虔进攻之，癸亥，拔管城，获振、仲，斩首七千级，俘虏万人。诏封桓冲子谦为宜阳侯。以桓石虔领河东太守。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9193,"number":8,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f492-db0e-11ef-8c7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"江","place_name_jianti_auto":"江","resolved_place_entity_id":48,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4d7-db0e-11ef-a88e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"9是歲，江東大饑。","content_fanyi":"这一年，长江以南地区发生了严重饥荒。","content_jianti_auto":"9是岁，江东大饥。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9194,"number":9,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f4d6-db0e-11ef-b784-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"六年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"六年","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a2f9f46a-db0e-11ef-b04c-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（辛巳、三八一）","year_int":381},"message":"success","success":true}